[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 3060.549, "timestamp": "00:51:00", "text": "变量，每次"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3063.829, "timestamp": "00:51:03", "text": "我运行这个特定的按钮时，它都会有一个变量值。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3066.549, "timestamp": "00:51:06", "text": "昨天我把它搞复杂了，加了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3073.829, "timestamp": "00:51:13", "text": "我意识到，我思考了一段时间后学到了一些东西，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3077.91, "timestamp": "00:51:17", "text": "帮助我的人也告诉"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3080.15, "timestamp": "00:51:20", "text": "我，你"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3084.39, "timestamp": "00:51:24", "text": "可以设置默认变量，比如当你"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3087.589, "timestamp": "00:51:27", "text": "没有按下按钮时。 所以，这个"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3090.23, "timestamp": "00:51:30", "text": "变量应该为零，对吧？如果你"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3092.23, "timestamp": "00:51:32", "text": "按下按钮，它就会变成 1；"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3094.069, "timestamp": "00:51:34", "text": "如果你再按一次，它就会"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3097.43, "timestamp": "00:51:37", "text": "变成 2，以此类推，它会随着"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3102.95, "timestamp": "00:51:42", "text": "按下的次数增加而自动递增，对吧？所以，是的，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3105.67, "timestamp": "00:51:45", "text": "这个东西，我们在这里要做的是，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3108.069, "timestamp": "00:51:48", "text": "我们要添加一个"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3109.91, "timestamp": "00:51:49", "text": "叫做"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3112.79, "timestamp": "00:51:52", "text": "TTV"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3118.47, "timestamp": "00:51:58", "text": "TT 消息运行、TTU TV DTV"}]